      },
      "message": "docs(process): classify-effort skill - one way to choose an issue's effort label\n\nAdds .claude/skills/classify-effort/: classify one issue, sweep the open\nissues that have no effort label, or audit existing labels read-only.\nIt applies AGENTS.md's effort table and safety floor, weighs the work that\nis left (the next bounded stage of an umbrella, not the whole programme),\nand never lowers a label - only the maintainer does.\n\nAGENTS.md \"Set at filing\" points at the skill. PROCESS_VERSION 11 -> 12.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Fable 5.2 <noreply@anthropic.com>",
